mage":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/782962f34f37a63e7efaa0940a600c40?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":22,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2023-04-27T17:02:06.233Z"},{"id":"gstawu4IE","title":"Retrieve an Object with Desired Subresources with API Platform","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/04/filter-subresources-with-api-platform/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/retrieve-an-object-with-desired-subresources-with-api-platform-gstawu4ie","summary":"Learn how to retrieve an object with desired subresources using API Platform by creating custom filters and using data providers and extensions. Improve performance by using extensions instead of data providers.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/88ae8cf1eb8f36a83cc3dff07f4f5806?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-20T10:23:14.589Z"},{"id":"OLY9gsGhW","title":"Effective Strategies for Testing React Native Apps: Striking a Balance Between Testing UI and Business Logic","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/04/effective-testing-react-native/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/effective-strategies-for-testing-react-native-apps-striking-a-balance-between-testing-ui-and-busine-oly9gsghw","summary":"Striking a balance between testing UI and business logic in React Native apps is crucial. Writing unit tests for UIs can be problematic as they focus on replicating the rendering environment rather than testing the underlying business logic. Extracting logic from the UI into hooks simplifies testing by focusing on testing the business logic. End-to-end tests help mitigate the risk of regressions in UI elements. Overall, a pragmatic approach that combines different testing strategies is recommended.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/4c2ed2acbcdb7f257d1c08ce0830f9b3?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-20T08:35:20.760Z"},{"id":"iqmJmw8Gt","title":"HubSpot forms on steroids with Cloudflare Pages","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/04/hubspot-forms-with-cloudflare/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/hubspot-forms-on-steroids-with-cloudflare-pages-iqmjmw8gt","summary":"Learn how to overcome the performance issues of using the native HubSpot form site by deploying a high-performance website using SvelteKit and Cloudflare Pages that leverages the HubSpot API.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/fec670612102b29288f4a7c8b6d86a87?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-13T20:57:00.648Z"},{"id":"Hq88VcaDe","title":"Using Sentry for performance monitoring","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/04/using-sentry-for-performance-monitoring/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/using-sentry-for-performance-monitoring-hq88vcade","summary":"Learn how to leverage Sentry for performance monitoring and improvement. Enable performance monitoring, parse metrics, define alerts, and analyze traces to identify and resolve performance issues.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5d06fe741fea6c9d5d96886690318448?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-13T13:08:05.161Z"},{"id":"wJVlFEDcl","title":"Saving Canvas Animations With MediaRecorder","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/03/saving-canvas-animations/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/saving-canvas-animations-with-mediarecorder-wjvlfedcl","summary":"Learn how to save canvas animations using MediaRecorder and convert them to different formats like mp4.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/297d4d235403793e20c24cbb63fc7075?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-05T15:28:26.147Z"},{"id":"Inn1Tarxr","title":"Browzwear API Tips and Tricks","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/04/browzwear-tips-and-tricks/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/browzwear-api-tips-and-tricks-inn1tarxr","summary":"Learn how to create Browzwear plugins to integrate more finely into your workflow and add tailor-made features. Resolve the popup from Adobe Illustrator when making changes to an AI artwork. Use the observer pattern to deal with waiting for VStitcher to finish a task before a command can continue.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a73a41072b98f7f21a72e6f40095380d?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-05T13:09:26.169Z"},{"id":"lv6rkMX9d","title":"How to safely deploy new features without breaking your production","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/03/safely-deploy-new-features-in-production/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-safely-deploy-new-features-without-breaking-your-production-lv6rkmx9d","summary":"Learn how to safely deploy new features without breaking your production using Canary Release or Canary Deployment strategies. These strategies allow you to test new features on a subset of users before rolling them out to all users, enabling better monitoring and evaluation of performance.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/19d64485d637d329fea8a94560d85bfc?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-31T14:46:28.728Z"},{"id":"ThJhE2aSq","title":"Are Typecript Enums Really Harmful?","url":"https://blog.theodo.com/2023/03/are-typescript-enums-really-harmful/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/are-typecript-enums-really-harmful--thjhe2asq","summary":"The post discusses the usage of TypeScript enums and explores the arguments against their use. It also presents alternatives to TypeScript enums and recommends string enums as a better choice.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/bfa1b797842009e3ad125c7693a11f96?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":11,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-30T09:39:12.894Z"},{"id":"kRjNnQ9eP","title":"Handling Supabase Pa